WEBVTT

00:07:58.866 --> 00:08:03.006
which was first published
in a newspaper "El Expresso" in Lisbon,

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.260
was picked by an editor
at the "New York Times"

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:08.022
and reprinted in
the international editions.

00:08:09.609 --> 00:08:10.974
This thing blew up.

00:08:11.343 --> 00:08:14.445
It was denounced as anti-Semitic,

00:08:14.469 --> 00:08:16.715
triggered widespread outrage,

00:08:16.739 --> 00:08:17.906
apologies

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.626
and a lot of damage control by the Times.

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:23.962
A month after, my editor told me

00:08:23.986 --> 00:08:27.506
they were ending
political cartoons altogether.

00:08:29.069 --> 00:08:33.115
So we could, and we should,
have a discussion about that cartoon.